{"c":[{"name":"20261016T223043Z-086a0d75fd95fd94","text":"Claude Code proves an install by its record, not its folder: installed_plugins.json in the plugins root (beside cache/) lists each installPath; --plugin-dir (@inline) and synced copies have none; orphans keep a version-named folder plus .orphaned_at. Cursor has no such record.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261017T010120Z-43ea3096fec682fc","text":"Claude Code copies even directory-marketplace plugins (source ./ too) into <plugins root>/cache/<mkt>/<plugin>/<version>; installed_plugins.json there records only that copy, never the checkout. CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR and CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR both move the plugins root.","type":"note"}]}
